  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help Loiza&apos;s Youth Access Post-secondary Education</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">High poverty rates and low college enrollment and completion among the population of Loiza, Puerto Rico, have made it near impossible for its youth to achieve economic mobility. With your support, we will help 80 disadvantaged students from the community continue their path towards obtaining a college degree. Your donation will go towards a stipend of $300 each to cover costs tied to their college experiences like transportation, school supplies, tutoring, food, and other essentials.</narrative>
  </description>
